    "id": "international-amateur-film-festival-oujda",
    "description": "Festival International du Film Amateur d'Oujda (FIFAO), organized by the Association Message d'Art pour le développement et la créativité, screens amateur short films from Morocco and abroad and hosts workshops on screenwriting, directing and photography. It has usually run in December, though its 2022 edition shifted to November; no editions have been confirmed since 2022.",
